## ObjectType: Customer Order

Local operational extension; no equivalent GS1 class asserted.

### Data Properties

| Name | Display Name | Type | Description | Mapped Field |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| order_id | Order id | string | Stable unique source-row identifier. | order_id |
| customer_id | Customer id | string | Foreign key to organizations; blank creates no edge. | customer_id |
| location_id | Location id | string | Foreign key to locations; blank creates no edge. | location_id |
| order_date | Order date | date | Day-only date governed by business and knowledge cutoff contract. | order_date |
| due_date | Due date | date | Day-only date governed by business and knowledge cutoff contract. | due_date |
| known_date | Known date | date | Day-only date governed by business and knowledge cutoff contract. | known_date |
| priority | Priority | decimal | Exact Decimal value; units/rules follow business contract; unknown is not zero. | priority |
| status | Status | string | Synthetic business value with equivalent bilingual meaning. Allowed values: Closed, Open. | status |
| status_code | Status code | string | Stable machine code; localized display value is separate. Allowed values: closed, open. | status_code |

